            "summary": "SpaceX agreed to buy an additional $2.6 billion in spectrum licenses from EchoStar, building on the $17 billion worth of licenses that it agreed to buy earlier this year.  The spectrum purchases give Elon Musk\u2019s rocket and satellite-internet company an expanded foothold in the mobile-phone business and will give EchoStar a SpaceX stake that tops $11 billion at the rocket company's current share price.  SpaceX provides home broadband service through its Starlink business and has dipped into the mobile-phone sector through a U.S. partnership with T-Mobile.",
